{"reviewId": "1204406_7X40oUjTY", "review": {"abstract": "经济中存在长度为15～25年的长期波动。这种波动在美国的许多经济活动尤其是建筑业中表现得特别明显，所以库兹涅茨周期也被称为建筑业周期。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "chapterUid": 14, "content": "现在机构整体悲观或许也是因为地产下行也是为期二十年的中期问题，而即使是ai变革或许也难已解决广泛的就业，民众收入的问题。稳定股市或许可以降低一些企业的综合成本间接带动就业，但是这里确实是制度级别的改革才可以。而不是危机下开枪换炮。社会主义国家集权中央的力量要很重视，但是客观的事实也要重视。行业选择层面重视结构化，集中化。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "25093-25160", "createTime": 1736383570, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "1204406_7X40oUjTY", "userVid": 1204406, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 14, "chapterTitle": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "author": {"userVid": 1204406, "name": "刘洋fine", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hzVGicX27IG3XwOZ5OTMdr1qKXZibkUlJvIP1jiaDNnEjvfkANsuxV0utGWS4kbleHic4TtOWpEhmDs/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-E-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments"